{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_08_beg","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_08","title":"影与灰","storyCode":"GA-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e22f93277bc812134c0db7b635e3473a5b07ddf0eaeda1ec1e0ad2789ac4bd5b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，自掏腰包吧，这里的维修费用很贵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午茶的甜点往后只能减半了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下！我听到大教堂方向传来战斗声，您没事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......？！是异端袭击了您吗？......这是我的失职！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么紧张，保拉里奥，还记得上次大教堂掰腕比赛的冠军是谁吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是稍微活动了一下手腕，不小心搞出了一点小意外而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城内的骚乱已经平息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他们撤退了。我都还没来得及炸爽——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请问可以进来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，抱歉，教宗阁下，我失态了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_358_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说，您要找的人已经到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进吧，孩子们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下，向您致敬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下，您好，我是塞茜莉亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，欢迎，这里有点乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝茶一般配什么甜点？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g4_laterano_cathedralliving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......需要我做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，让我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"往自己的茶杯里加块方糖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，你得多加几块，糖分能舒缓紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！好、好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下，如果我......想要离开拉特兰，您会同意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不允许，你会服从吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个可怜的老头子，最大的愿望就是窝在软乎乎的摇椅里安度晚年，哪有工夫去管小女孩的旅行计划呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可塞茜莉亚是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么？难不成她还能是天使和魔鬼的混血，让启示降临的圣徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亚只是个想要出门看看的小姑娘，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还带着你妈妈的守护铳，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对不起！我是不是应该交给艾泽尔哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"获得守护铳是一件庄严的事，原本得举行隆重的仪式，需要监护人出席，导师的首肯，还有一大堆麻烦的文书工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你也没到可以获得守护铳的年纪。所以，悄悄地把它带走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢说这是给你的礼物。每一把铳都是拉特兰的宝贵财富。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，若只是孩子思念母亲的寄托，我相信不会有人阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带上它吧，孩子。你的身体状况可能不允许你扣下扳机，干掉什么坏蛋......但它能提醒你，不管走到哪里，你都是从拉特兰出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，谢谢您，阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾泽尔，陪着她一起吧，算你的长期外勤任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得偶尔回来看看就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......真的有这个资格吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当然有。你做出了选择，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾泽尔","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会竭尽全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让塞茜莉亚被欺负了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，去吧，时光可不等人。到了我这个年纪，就只会满脑子想着睡午觉啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗爷爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会一直走下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我将为你祝祷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗阁下，这就足够了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他们一起吃了点心，这就足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......按照您的指示，那个男人已经离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是应该多留他一会儿？也许吃块巧克力能让他打起点精神？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇尔丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......教宗阁下，您太心软了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，薇尔丽芙，我们注定无法成为寒夜中的炬火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，为抱薪者端上一杯热茶......总还是做得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“这片大地难以容忍美善”......愿那些不承认这一点的人能够成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也该做下一件事了。骚乱已经平息，召集各国使节吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教宗","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启示既昭，我将行我须行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么想，菲亚梅塔，你不用承担任何东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这是我的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管他那时正觊觎什么力量，想探究什么秘密，要得到什么答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不管他的崇高理想，伟大事业，救赎了谁又引导了谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不为信仰，不为拉特兰城，不为戍卫队，甚至不为逝去的时光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不原谅，只因为——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你辜负了信任你的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么你还能安然无恙地出现在这里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么连教宗阁下都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......又有什么为什么......路从一开始就不存在，又能在虚无中寻得什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的忏悔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忏悔？不，我没有忏悔......何方可供我忏悔？没有光亮，没有前途，受难者必将受难，悲哀者只有悲哀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有得救，没有乐园，这里是拉特兰，这里只属于我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果光芒本就是虚影......不，不是虚影......是实在......不如我们所愿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从未有过光芒......又何谈照亮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么胡话，安多恩？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我放弃了吗，我为什么在这里，我放弃了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这障壁如此之厚，我怎么能够拥抱他们？我怎么可以拥抱他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我只是个兜售虚假希望的骗子......骗到自己也信了这说辞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，我不明白。它的判断是什么？它想让我去向何方？它的存在本身明明已经堵死了我的道路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向何处寻觅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩！给我清醒一点！看清楚站在你面前的人是谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁......啊......菲亚梅塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在发什么疯？！你那副振振有词、理直气壮的样子呢？你的骨头被抽走了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让我对一个痴人疯汉兴师问罪！看清楚你现在在哪里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在拉特兰，菲亚梅塔。我在大教堂之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高兴与你们重逢......不，我现在一点也不高兴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是还会抵挡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有脸抵挡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说对不起。安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，跪下来，对莫斯提马，还有蕾缪安的方向，说“对不起”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是觉得自己没有错吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的错误不可胜数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你*拉特兰俚语*还挺得意是不是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听着，安多恩，你有什么信念，我不关心，你的信念全完蛋，我也不在意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安原谅你，莫斯提马原谅你，伊万杰利斯塔十一世原谅你，就算整个拉特兰都原谅你——我也绝不原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我很抱歉，菲亚梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你该道歉的人不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......当年的事，若再来一次......也许我仍会这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不是吧，认真的？你非要在菲亚梅塔面前这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且你现在不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好。安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿出你的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，这不会有结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我*拉特兰俚语*是为了结果？！你以为我在这里把你杀了，蕾缪安的八年就能回来吗？！莫斯提马的人生就能复原吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*拉特兰俚语*结果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要找你算账，是因为我*拉特兰俚语*就是要找你算账！懂了吗？安多恩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这是你的执念吗，菲亚梅塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我再说一遍，安多恩——拿出你的铳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
